      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "什么叫做机械运动？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "2",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "为什么需要指出一个物体的运动是相对于什么物体",
        "而言的？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "3",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
