      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "试指出行驶着的火车中的旅客相对于什么物体来说是静止",
        "的？相对于什么物体来说是运动的？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "2",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "小船沿河划行. 当在雾中看不见河岸的时候，为什么指不出",
        "船运动的方向？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "3",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "表针末端的运动轨迹是一条什么样的线？"
